n, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235238,"global_rank":93950,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16266},{"name":"SciTechDude/PyTextArt","owner":"SciTechDude","html_url":"https://github.com/SciTechDude/PyTextArt","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Generates Bow Tie pattern of  given row numbers","topics":[],"score":235235,"global_rank":93956,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16267},{"name":"taintedkernel/dashcamgps","owner":"taintedkernel","html_url":"https://github.com/taintedkernel/dashcamgps","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Playing around with Tesseract, OpenCV to extract GPS information overlaid on dashcam images","topics":[],"score":235235,"global_rank":93957,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16268},{"name":"brianwright2/isolation_forest","owner":"brianwright2","html_url":"https://github.com/brianwright2/isolation_forest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementation of isolation forest algorithm in Python","topics":[],"score":235215,"global_rank":93977,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16269},{"name":"ykmr1224/utility","owner":"ykmr1224","html_url":"https://github.com/ykmr1224/utility","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235212,"global_rank":93987,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16270},{"name":"AustinBrunkhorst/nebula-pad","owner":"AustinBrunkhorst","html_url":"https://github.com/Au